<LVClass LVVersion="13008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.DefaultMenu" Type="Str">VariantMessage.mnu</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Variantmessages have a type specifier and a variant with data. The type is application specific and any client will have to cast the variant to the actual data it represents.

These messages can be used to send information within the labview application as they don't have to be serialized to strings for sending over an external interface.

Messages that are of variant type can be used to send messages to the driver itself. The driver will examine all incoming messages and any variant type messages will be interpreted according to the type integer</Property>
